{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/nzvksohcrcmwun7e7cd7rwvpgf6jgys.mp3","text":"你连自己的分内之事都完成不了，需要我来帮忙？","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/sv8sfkk4pljbapurpbt9zz0y7h87jth.mp3","text":"不要让我去给其他人做法术指导了，我可没兴趣去跟一群普通人玩源石技艺游戏。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/00/aph4avu4wf1mim1psxkrz9kmgqbdsza.mp3","text":"我会在这里不是因为我需要在这里，只是因为我想而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/rmnw8gj4ncpyukichfhqzz4lj5t775p.mp3","text":"我最讨厌的就是不停问为什么的人，希望你不是。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/t5n6fin72al7ol9xq8yhsj0secgt293.mp3","text":"看来你已经对我的源石技艺有所了解了，希望你自己也清楚其危险性。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/1gjxc0o5v7o14kxffxrk9y0ph0lqaku.mp3","text":"反应过来的时候，源石技艺和这把法杖已经伴随着我了。我一点都不记得什么时候得到了这样的能力，当然我也并不在意。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/dx0en0m8oruj9f7mla08m4ol88e33yy.mp3","text":"我有着各种各样的记忆，我也不知道它们是怎么来的，我也不知道哪些是真正属于我的。为了找到记忆的来源，我一直在各个国家中来回旅行，而现在来到了罗德岛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/be22asw29ux8o8x4ekqxe4ngzk4e4ez.mp3","text":"没有什么比一份冰淇淋更能让我从混乱的记忆中冷静下来了，以前我还是一个人的时候多亏了它们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/omwhjy5qenlzy8tkhuzqip425tdv0rt.mp3","text":"在罗德岛的记忆跟以前的那些完全不同，充满了真实感，第一次让我觉得自己就是自己。这一切也多亏了你和罗德岛的大家。......干嘛，该感谢的时候我还是会感谢的好吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/ie85asv0qvwbuyhm33ld7qljyu1kco2.mp3","text":"啧......浪费时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/acy6qe9p2bgpwnt78jgzn75m6iddiit.mp3","text":"我是史尔特尔，你就是他们说的博士吗。今后我会在罗德岛工作，希望你们不要让我觉得无聊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/3k2jcn3dyhcf68api793q2777wu8ixy.mp3","text":"就这样？","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/moxadiizuqeqqqvxlai4gql1kzoiriy.mp3","text":"见识过我的实力之后，开始重视我了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/g7q4af3rzwd4n5w2zgogry7u2c8skc5.mp3","text":"看重的不是这能力，而是我本身？既然你都这样说了，那我也拿出相应的努力来回报你吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/6jsn4njch72kzhjvovhhb7w6xazznfw.mp3","text":"需要我了吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/edn7f0uy6gghi76a8hctc1ph15qd9xn.mp3","text":"我一个人就够了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/7wpfznxkl1qje47kk9oc937be3cqxkz.mp3","text":"出发了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/97gtvxv3vr3beu32olvk5e4miqkn9fq.mp3","text":"要消灭的就是他们吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/n5i1us2ds8lkdwh5vh3rxfinbzek98g.mp3","text":"不要对我指手画脚。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/25/nawnqykt3jliu0pxz9h9qw5ikge3zxp.mp3","text":"不要多说，我知道。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/jr49aws8g6q8tdyksua5bl4xczjwca6.mp3","text":"不错的地方。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/mnjk6w39xz2g8bo10fxodly0fmy3qly.mp3","text":"我上了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/sdh1u374bob40684nt4rtcyhll36atj.mp3","text":"去死吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/ncmzbgsim174emsayjhdd4axqqubxga.mp3","text":"一个也别想逃走。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/34oa8sgmjpcj6cglykhdxzoyswjkylh.mp3","text":"莱万汀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/5erf7psjnltn859nb35kldv2aph9crt.mp3","text":"愚蠢的家伙！","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/7aj64560er37fibix7iakz2hfqkwtas.mp3","text":"哼，小菜一碟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/8kr3t4bg607w5g0lr6itgfvbti3k5xt.mp3","text":"理所当然。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/m6ck1tec8w18tuhd7gfrf6xilb7fehi.mp3","text":"连这么简单的事情都做不好吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/3r74r9utidp71wjh9mz4br69he2g4mw.mp3","text":"没用的人都赶快撤退！这里我来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/8veua2apy9dk6dqfrj5li113kxpu3c9.mp3","text":"还算是干净的房间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/rlx2qqbhgkwbbu0na552w8j83iwaz1v.mp3","text":"我知道自己走。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/hda1yr5hf6dgufwjbok5v59urcoso89.mp3","text":"安静。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/kv1ms3j9572y5w9no1chfj6qxhvfq68.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/f8vet3vfdt1l9acrxrky5pdbuqu9kbo.mp3","text":"这个日子总是让我有些烦躁，时间年复一年地过去，我离过去的记忆越来越远......哼，不想这些了。喂，陪我去甲板上走走吧。吹吹冷风，或许可以让我冷静下来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/c41zgap0t4b9u2dl0mlmqxbub1p7zkn.mp3","text":"啊，你在这里。","alt":"voice_cn/char_350_surtr/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/s8fo1oc2letbn5k32flunuc2a8hu5he.mp3","text":"你连自己的分内之事都完成不了，需要我来帮忙？","alt":"voice/char_350_surtr/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/34jfe33wic2u4t8757ugumcdiaku4ik.mp3","text":"不要让我去给其他人做法术指导了，我可没兴趣去跟一群普通人玩源石技艺游戏。","alt":"voice/char_350_surtr/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/r9byj0ce2a4t791o7n6qbkhyr4yess3.mp3","text":"我会在这里不是因为我需要在这里，只是因为我想而已。","alt":"voice/char_350_surtr/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/2tmcq86u8atp8clf0ow4jy8lkkolrla.mp3","text":"我最讨厌的就是不停问为什么的人，希望你不是。","alt":"voice/char_350_surtr/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/q3zx66vxoiwo7c61j2tdbzbgss9zb62.mp3","text":"看来你已经对我的源石技艺有所了解了，希望你自己也清楚其危险性。","alt":"voice/char_350_surtr/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/dx3f9ylzlsaorbchrfnlk7ow5jqzsm0.mp3","text":"反应过来的时候，源石技艺和这把法杖已经伴随着我了。我一点都不记得什么时候得到了这样的能力，当然我也并不在意。","alt":"voice/char_350_surtr/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/7ojy1zpsfwuy6iqtzgtg5hquj3bue9i.mp3","text":"我有着各种各样的记忆，我也不知道它们是怎么来的，我也不知道哪些是真正属于我的。为了找到记忆的来源，我一直在各个国家中来回旅行，而现在来到了罗德岛。","alt":"voice/char_350_surtr/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/88/mt9817t4jnoxdthj1183ihx47gg09wu.